    <briefdescription>
<para>A group of tasks to be run on a thread pool. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Thread pool tasks in different groups can run on the same threadpool but can be waited for separately. It is even possible for tasks of one group to submit and wait for tasks of another group, as long as this does not form a loop. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
